---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/hero.webp';
import stage from '../assets/portrait.webp';
import personal from '../assets/loren-standing.webp';
import book from '../assets/book.jpg';
import TestimonialSection from '../components/TestimonialSection.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import {visibleEvidence} from '../lib/content-visibility';
import {site} from '../data/site';
const proof=(await getCollection('testimonials',e=>e.id==='deborah-feldman'&&visibleEvidence(e.data,import.meta.env.SITE_ENV==='production')))[0];
---
<Base title="Turn your story into momentum" description="Keynotes, coaching, and keynote writing with Dr. Loren Michaels Harris. Bring honesty, energy, and a human connection to your next event.">
<section class="cinema-hero"><div class="hero-grid wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> SPEAKER. COACH. STORYTELLER.</p><h1>Turn your<br/>story into<br/><span>momentum.</span></h1><p class="hero-name">DR. LOREN MICHAELS HARRIS</p><p class="hero-description">Keynotes, coaching, and keynote writing for people ready to move their message forward.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button gold" href="/contact/?service=speaking">Discuss your event <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/speaking/">Explore speaking <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><figure class="cinema-portrait"><Image src={portrait} alt="Loren Michaels Harris, smiling in a navy jacket with bright pink cuffs" widths={[500,800,1100]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 50vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>HONEST STORIES.<br/>HUMAN CONNECTION.</span><span class="caption-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>FOR THE STAGE. FOR YOUR MESSAGE. FOR WHAT’S NEXT.</span><a href="#in-the-room">Step inside <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="proof-band" id="in-the-room"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><figure><Image src={stage} alt="Loren speaking with a seated audience at an event" widths={[400,700,1000]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 40vw" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>In the room with Loren · Photograph: Scott R. Gane</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">REAL ROOMS. REAL CONNECTION.</p>{proof?<><blockquote>“{proof.data.excerpt}”</blockquote><p class="attribution">{proof.data.person} <span>— {proof.data.role}</span></p><a class="text-link" href="/testimonials/#deborah-feldman">Read the full testimonial ↗</a></>:<><h2>A message starts<br/>with the people.</h2><p>Leadership teams, educators, and community gatherings. Explore how Loren approaches the room.</p><a href="/services/speaking/">Explore speaking ↗</a></>}</div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap speaking-feature"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / ON THE STAGE</p><h2>A room full of people.<br/>A reason to <span class="gold-text">connect.</span></h2></div><div class="speaking-details"><p>Plan a keynote around the people you’re bringing together. Loren brings personal storytelling, humor, and an honest conversation about leadership, resilience, and change.</p><div class="topic-list"><span>Leadership & connection</span><span>Resilience & perspective</span><span>The power of your story</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/speaking/">Find the right fit for your event ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section service-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THREE WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER</p><h2>Your audience.<br/>Your voice. <span class="gold-text">Your next move.</span></h2></div><p class="section-aside">From the room you’re bringing together<br/>to the message you’re ready to share.</p></div><div class="service-panels"><a href="/services/speaking/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">01 / THE ROOM</span><h3>Speaking<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>For organizers bringing teams, students, or communities together. Explore a keynote shaped around your audience.</p><span class="panel-link">Explore speaking</span></a><a href="/services/coaching/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">02 / THE VOICE</span><h3>Coaching<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>For leaders and emerging speakers. Work on your message, story structure, delivery, and presence.</p><span class="panel-link">Explore coaching</span></a><a href="/services/keynote-writing/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">03 / THE MESSAGE</span><h3>Keynote writing<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>For an important talk that needs the right words. Develop a narrative, a draft, and a clear path through revisions.</p><span class="panel-link">Explore keynote writing</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section story-section"><div class="wrap split"><figure class="story-photo"><Image src={personal} alt="Loren seated on outdoor steps, smiling" widths={[400,700,1000]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 45vw" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Photograph: Scott R. Gane</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BEHIND THE MESSAGE</p><h2>Before the stage,<br/>there was <em>a story.</em></h2><p>Loren’s journey from foster care to speaking shapes the questions he brings to an audience: how do we understand what we’ve lived through, and what do we do with it?</p><p>His P3 framework begins there. Pain. Perspective. Possibility. An invitation to examine your experience and find the message you want to carry forward.</p><div class="p3-line"><span>Pain</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Perspective</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Possibility</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet the person behind the message ↗</a></div></div></section>
<TestimonialSection compact/>
<section class="section wrap beyond"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / BEYOND THE STAGE</p><h2>The conversation<br/>doesn’t end here.</h2></div></div><div class="beyond-grid"><article class="show-tile"><div class="show-topline"><span>THE SHOW</span><span class="live-dot"></span></div><h3>Bathrobe<br/><em>Moments.</em></h3><p>Come as you are.<br/>Leave with a different perspective.</p><a class="text-link" href="/bathrobe-moments/">Watch & meet the show ↗</a><span class="show-watermark" aria-hidden="true">BM.</span></article><article class="program-tile"><p class="eyebrow">THE PROGRAM</p><span class="orbit-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>The Mindset<br/>Revolution.</h3><p>Explore the beliefs and experiences that shape how you lead and live.</p><a class="text-link" href="/the-mindset-revolution/">Explore the program ↗</a></article><article class="book-tile"><Image src={book} alt="From Splintered to Centered book cover" width={183} height={275} loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BOOK</p><h3>From Splintered<br/>to Centered.</h3><p>A closer look at the relationship you have with yourself.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.book}>Discover the book ↗</a></div></article></div></section>
</Base>
